# QA M3, Stage 4: a 6-tile drop survives (game-design.md "New mechanics",
# D-054). Like falkenstein_goal_walk_off, but Resi only nudges herself off
# the Aberseeblick's top (row 10) at a crawl (R 12, then she coasts), so
# she falls 6 tiles straight down onto the goal meadow (row 16) and
# *lands* there (frame 1593, x 3645, left of the pole) instead of being
# caught by the Maibaum mid-fall: the climb camera follows the fall and she
# is alive. She then walks into the pole at its base (complete at 1624,
# 100 points). If the solver route changes, re-copy the prefix and
# re-check the frames.
